# Certified interpretation of the packed exterior basis

Every full packed form is identified with its published upper triangle.
An arbitrary selected XOR therefore lies in their binary span. The later
generator checks supply explicit selection coefficients, without any
assumption of linear independence. Source: KernelEquations/source/README.md.
-/

